    CYBER PANEL V1
    Minimal transparent cyber UI for Xeno / Roblox

    Tabs:
      • CHARACTER
      • AUTOFARM (placeholder for later)

    CHARACTER:
      • Player nickname
      • Live X / Y / Z coordinates + COPY
      • Walk Speed toggle + slider
      • Noclip toggle
      • Fly toggle (WASD / Space / LeftCtrl) + speed slider
      • Auto Click toggle
      • Infinite Jump toggle

    Everything starts OFF.
]]

